WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.298
Leaving Phrase Strings,

2
00:00:02.298 --> 00:00:04.132
you keep your locale files,

3
00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:07.730
your i18n library, and
your verified translations.

4
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.273
General Translation
imports your locale files,

5
00:00:11.273 --> 00:00:14.035
then translates each
new or changed string.

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:19.353
Run phrase pull without
untranslated keys or fallbacks,

7
00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:20.687
so gaps are left out.

8
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.472
Then deactivate each Repo Sync,

9
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:27.070
and remove phrase push and
phrase pull steps from your CI.

10
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.425
Import your term base
into a Context Group,

11
00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:33.222
and move key descriptions
to per-key context.

12
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.587
Run npx gt upload first,

13
00:00:36.587 --> 00:00:39.246
which stores your
translations as completed,

14
00:00:39.246 --> 00:00:41.579
then run npx gt translate.

15
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.551
Your team now ships Brazilian
Portuguese with each release.
